    DR-001 Deferred Revenue Schedule Views
    =======================================

    Primary views for account.deferred.schedule — the header model for
    deferred revenue / deferred expense recognition schedules.

    Implements DR-001 acceptance criteria:
      - Form view with draft -> confirmed -> closed state machine
      - Header workflow buttons (Confirm, Generate Cut-off, Close, Reset to Draft)
      - Chatter with activities and audit trail
      - Recognition lines inline list within a notebook tab
      - Analytic distribution widget
      - List, kanban, and search views with state-based decoration
      - Default action opening the schedule list

    Model: account.deferred.schedule
      - inherits mail.thread and mail.activity.mixin
      - order = 'start_date desc, name'
      - check_company_auto = True

    Views registered here:
      1. view_account_deferred_schedule_form    (form with state machine + chatter)
      2. view_account_deferred_schedule_tree    (list with state decoration)
      3. view_account_deferred_schedule_kanban  (kanban grouped by state)
      4. view_account_deferred_schedule_search  (filters, group-by)
      5. action_account_deferred_schedule       (primary window action)

    Referenced by:
      - views/menuitem.xml via menu_deferred_schedule (primary entry point)
      - models/account_deferred_schedule.py action_generate_cutoff returns
        the DR-003 cut-off wizard action (defined in cutoff_wizard_views.xml)

    AAP alignment notes:
      - Uses the modern Odoo 19 <chatter/> tag; the legacy
        <div class="oe_chatter"> pattern has been removed from Odoo 19 core.
      - Kanban template uses <t t-name="card"> (Odoo 19 standard), replacing
        the legacy <t t-name="kanban-box">.
      - The model does not expose an `action_view_lines` server method; the
        recognition lines are surfaced via the form's notebook tab instead,
        removing the need for a redundant smart button.

    Rules compliance (AAP §0.7):
      - R-01 Module Independence: only references account.deferred.schedule,
        account.deferred.line, core models (account.move, account.account,
        res.partner, res.company). No sibling new-module references.
      - R-02 No Enterprise Dependencies: no Enterprise view/model references.
      - R-03 _inherit Correctness: views target the net-new schedule model
        (which uses _name + _inherit mixins on mail.thread/mail.activity.mixin).
      - R-05 No Core Field Redefinition: declares views for a net-new model
        only; no modification of core views here.
      - R-07 No sudo() without justification: no sudo() in this file.
-->
<odoo>

    <!-- =================================================================
         SECTION 1: Form View — Primary Editing Interface
         ================================================================= -->
    <record id="view_account_deferred_schedule_form" model="ir.ui.view">
        <field name="name">account.deferred.schedule.form</field>
        <field name="model">account.deferred.schedule</field>
        <field name="arch" type="xml">
            <form string="Deferred Revenue Schedule">
                <!-- =============================================
                     Header — state machine workflow
                     ============================================= -->
                <header>
                    <button name="action_confirm"
                            type="object"
                            string="Confirm"
                            class="btn-primary"
                            invisible="state != 'draft'"
                            data-hotkey="v"/>
                    <button name="action_generate_cutoff"
                            type="object"
                            string="Generate Cut-off Entries"
                            class="btn-primary"
                            invisible="state != 'confirmed'"
                            data-hotkey="q"/>
                    <button name="action_close"
                            type="object"
                            string="Close"
                            class="btn-secondary"
                            invisible="state != 'confirmed'"
                            confirm="Close this schedule? This will prevent any further recognition posting."/>
                    <button name="action_draft"
                            type="object"
                            string="Reset to Draft"
                            class="btn-secondary"
                            invisible="state != 'confirmed'"
                            confirm="Reset to draft? This will remove all generated recognition lines."/>
                    <field name="state"
                           widget="statusbar"
                           statusbar_visible="draft,confirmed,closed"/>
                </header>

                <sheet>
                    <!-- =============================================
                         Title — schedule reference
                         ============================================= -->
                    <div class="oe_title">
                        <label for="name" class="oe_edit_only"/>
                        <h1>
                            <field name="name"
                                   readonly="1"
                                   placeholder="DEF-YYYY-00001"/>
                        </h1>
                    </div>

                    <!-- =============================================
                         Main field groups — row 1
                         ============================================= -->
                    <group>
                        <group string="Partner &amp; Source">
                            <field name="partner_id"
                                   readonly="state != 'draft'"
                                   options="{'no_create_edit': True}"/>
                            <field name="source_move_id"
                                   readonly="state != 'draft'"
                                   options="{'no_create': True}"
                                   domain="[('state','=','posted'),
                                            ('move_type','in',('out_invoice','in_invoice','out_refund','in_refund')),
                                            ('company_id','=',company_id)]"/>
                            <field name="source_move_line_id"
                                   readonly="state != 'draft'"
                                   options="{'no_create': True}"
                                   invisible="not source_move_id"
                                   domain="[('move_id','=',source_move_id)]"/>
                        </group>
                        <group string="Amounts">
                            <field name="total_amount"
                                   readonly="state != 'draft'"
                                   widget="monetary"/>
                            <field name="currency_id"
                                   groups="base.group_multi_currency"
                                   options="{'no_create': True}"
                                   readonly="state != 'draft'"/>
                            <field name="posted_amount"
                                   widget="monetary"
                                   readonly="1"/>
                            <field name="remaining_amount"
                                   widget="monetary"
                                   readonly="1"/>
                            <field name="completion_status"
                                   widget="badge"
                                   decoration-info="completion_status == 'active'"
                                   decoration-success="completion_status == 'completed'"
                                   decoration-warning="completion_status == 'on_hold'"
                                   readonly="1"/>
                        </group>
                    </group>

                    <!-- =============================================
                         Main field groups — row 2
                         ============================================= -->
                    <group>
                        <group string="Accounts">
                            <field name="deferred_account_id"
                                   readonly="state != 'draft'"
                                   options="{'no_create': True}"
                                   domain="[('account_type','in',
                                             ('liability_current','liability_non_current',
                                              'asset_current','asset_non_current')),
                                            ('active','=',True),
                                            ('company_ids','in',company_id)]"/>
                            <field name="recognition_account_id"
                                   readonly="state != 'draft'"
                                   options="{'no_create': True}"
                                   domain="[('account_type','in',
                                             ('income','income_other',
                                              'expense','expense_depreciation','expense_direct_cost')),
                                            ('active','=',True),
                                            ('company_ids','in',company_id)]"/>
                        </group>
                        <group string="Recognition Configuration">
                            <field name="recognition_method"
                                   readonly="state != 'draft'"/>
                            <field name="start_date"
                                   readonly="state != 'draft'"/>
                            <field name="end_date"
                                   readonly="state != 'draft'"/>
                            <field name="period_count" readonly="1"/>
                        </group>
                    </group>

                    <!-- =============================================
                         Analytic Distribution
                         ============================================= -->
                    <group string="Analytic Distribution"
                           groups="analytic.group_analytic_accounting">
                        <field name="analytic_distribution"
                               widget="analytic_distribution"
                               readonly="state != 'draft'"
                               nolabel="1"
                               colspan="2"/>
                    </group>

                    <!-- =============================================
                         Company (multi-company environments only)
                         ============================================= -->
                    <group groups="base.group_multi_company">
                        <field name="company_id"
                               readonly="state != 'draft'"
                               options="{'no_create': True}"/>
                    </group>

                    <!-- =============================================
                         Notebook — Recognition Lines tab
                         ============================================= -->
                    <notebook>
                        <page name="lines" string="Recognition Lines">
                            <field name="line_ids"
                                   readonly="state == 'closed'"
                                   context="{'default_schedule_id': id}">
                                <list string="Recognition Lines"
                                      editable="bottom"
                                      default_order="recognition_date asc, sequence asc">
                                    <field name="sequence" widget="handle"/>
                                    <field name="recognition_date"
                                           readonly="parent.state == 'closed' or state == 'posted'"/>
                                    <field name="recognition_amount"
                                           widget="monetary"
                                           sum="Total"
                                           readonly="parent.state == 'closed' or state == 'posted'"/>
                                    <field name="currency_id" column_invisible="True"/>
                                    <field name="days_in_period"
                                           readonly="1"
                                           optional="hide"/>
                                    <field name="state"
                                           widget="badge"
                                           decoration-info="state == 'draft'"
                                           decoration-success="state == 'posted'"/>
                                    <field name="move_id"
                                           readonly="1"
                                           optional="show"/>
                                </list>
                            </field>
                        </page>
                    </notebook>
                </sheet>

                <!-- =============================================
                     Chatter — mail.thread + mail.activity.mixin
                     Uses the Odoo 19 <chatter/> shortcut; the legacy
                     <div class="oe_chatter">...</div> pattern has been
                     removed from core and is no longer rendered.
                     ============================================= -->
                <chatter/>
            </form>
        </field>
    </record>

    <!-- =================================================================
         SECTION 2: List (Tree) View
         ================================================================= -->
    <record id="view_account_deferred_schedule_tree" model="ir.ui.view">
        <field name="name">account.deferred.schedule.list</field>
        <field name="model">account.deferred.schedule</field>
        <field name="arch" type="xml">
            <list string="Deferred Revenue Schedules"
                  decoration-info="state == 'draft'"
                  decoration-success="state == 'confirmed'"
                  decoration-muted="state == 'closed'"
                  default_order="start_date desc, name"
                  sample="1">
                <!--
                    Issue #19 fix: shortened column labels (Method,
                    Start, End, Status) so the list view fits at
                    1280px without truncation.
                -->
                <field name="name"/>
                <field name="partner_id"/>
                <field name="recognition_method"
                       string="Method"
                       optional="show"/>
                <field name="start_date" string="Start"/>
                <field name="end_date" string="End"/>
                <field name="total_amount" widget="monetary" sum="Total"/>
                <field name="posted_amount"
                       widget="monetary"
                       string="Posted"
                       optional="hide"/>
                <field name="remaining_amount"
                       widget="monetary"
                       string="Remaining"
                       optional="hide"/>
                <field name="currency_id" column_invisible="True"/>
                <field name="completion_status"
                       widget="badge"
                       string="Progress"
                       decoration-info="completion_status == 'active'"
                       decoration-success="completion_status == 'completed'"
                       decoration-warning="completion_status == 'on_hold'"
                       optional="show"/>
                <field name="state"
                       widget="badge"
                       string="Status"
                       decoration-info="state == 'draft'"
                       decoration-success="state == 'confirmed'"
                       decoration-muted="state == 'closed'"/>
                <field name="company_id"
                       groups="base.group_multi_company"
                       optional="hide"/>
            </list>
        </field>
    </record>

    <!-- =================================================================
         SECTION 3: Kanban View — Grouped by State
         Uses the Odoo 19 <t t-name="card"> template standard.  The
         legacy <t t-name="kanban-box"> pattern has been superseded.
         ================================================================= -->
    <record id="view_account_deferred_schedule_kanban" model="ir.ui.view">
        <field name="name">account.deferred.schedule.kanban</field>
        <field name="model">account.deferred.schedule</field>
        <field name="arch" type="xml">
            <kanban default_group_by="state"
                    class="o_kanban_small_column"
                    sample="1"
                    default_order="start_date desc, name">
                <!-- Dependency fields referenced by widgets but not
                     rendered directly as a <field> in the card body. -->
                <field name="currency_id"/>
                <field name="state"/>
                <templates>
                    <t t-name="card">
                        <div class="oe_kanban_global_click">
                            <div class="o_kanban_record_top mb-2">
                                <div class="o_kanban_record_headings">
                                    <strong class="o_kanban_record_title">
                                        <field name="name"/>
                                    </strong>
                                    <div class="o_kanban_record_subtitle">
                                        <field name="partner_id"/>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="o_kanban_record_body">
                                <div>
                                    <span class="text-muted">Total:</span>
                                    <field name="total_amount" widget="monetary"/>
                                </div>
                                <div>
                                    <span class="text-muted">Posted:</span>
                                    <field name="posted_amount" widget="monetary"/>
                                </div>
                                <div>
                                    <span class="text-muted">Period:</span>
                                    <field name="start_date"/> &#8211;
                                    <field name="end_date"/>
                                </div>
                                <div>
                                    <span class="text-muted">Method:</span>
                                    <field name="recognition_method"/>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="o_kanban_record_bottom">
                                <div class="oe_kanban_bottom_left">
                                    <field name="completion_status"
                                           widget="label_selection"
                                           options="{'classes': {'active': 'info',
                                                                 'completed': 'success',
                                                                 'on_hold': 'warning'}}"/>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </t>
                </templates>
            </kanban>
        </field>
    </record>

    <!-- =================================================================
         SECTION 4: Search View — Filters and Group-By
         ================================================================= -->
    <record id="view_account_deferred_schedule_search" model="ir.ui.view">
        <field name="name">account.deferred.schedule.search</field>
        <field name="model">account.deferred.schedule</field>
        <field name="arch" type="xml">
            <search string="Deferred Revenue Schedules">
                <field name="name"/>
                <field name="partner_id"/>
                <field name="source_move_id" string="Source Invoice"/>
                <field name="deferred_account_id"/>
                <field name="recognition_account_id"/>

                <separator/>

                <!-- State filters -->
                <filter name="filter_draft"
                        string="Draft"
                        domain="[('state', '=', 'draft')]"/>
                <filter name="filter_confirmed"
                        string="Confirmed"
                        domain="[('state', '=', 'confirmed')]"/>
                <filter name="filter_closed"
                        string="Closed"
                        domain="[('state', '=', 'closed')]"/>

                <separator/>

                <!-- Revenue vs Expense filters.
                     Partition schedules by recognition account type. -->
                <filter name="filter_deferred_revenue"
                        string="Deferred Revenue"
                        domain="[('recognition_account_id.account_type', 'in', ('income', 'income_other'))]"/>
                <filter name="filter_deferred_expenses"
                        string="Deferred Expenses"
                        domain="[('recognition_account_id.account_type', 'in', ('expense', 'expense_depreciation', 'expense_direct_cost'))]"/>

                <separator/>

                <!-- Completion status filters -->
                <filter name="filter_active"
                        string="Active"
                        domain="[('completion_status', '=', 'active')]"/>
                <filter name="filter_completed"
                        string="Completed"
                        domain="[('completion_status', '=', 'completed')]"/>
                <filter name="filter_on_hold"
                        string="On Hold"
                        domain="[('completion_status', '=', 'on_hold')]"/>

                <separator/>

                <!-- Date filters -->
                <filter name="filter_starts_this_year"
                        string="Starts This Year"
                        domain="[('start_date','&gt;=', (context_today()).strftime('%Y-01-01')),
                                 ('start_date','&lt;=', (context_today()).strftime('%Y-12-31'))]"/>

                <separator/>

                <!-- Group-By -->
                <group>
                    <filter name="group_by_state"
                            string="Status"
                            context="{'group_by': 'state'}"/>
                    <filter name="group_by_method"
                            string="Recognition Method"
                            context="{'group_by': 'recognition_method'}"/>
                    <filter name="group_by_partner"
                            string="Partner"
                            context="{'group_by': 'partner_id'}"/>
                    <filter name="group_by_completion"
                            string="Completion Status"
                            context="{'group_by': 'completion_status'}"/>
                    <filter name="group_by_start_month"
                            string="Start Month"
                            context="{'group_by': 'start_date:month'}"/>
                    <filter name="group_by_company"
                            string="Company"
                            context="{'group_by': 'company_id'}"
                            groups="base.group_multi_company"/>
                </group>
            </search>
        </field>
    </record>

    <!-- =================================================================
         SECTION 5: Window Action — Primary Entry Point
         Opens the list by default with Confirmed schedules pre-filtered
         (the active recognition pipeline users usually want first).
         ================================================================= -->
    <record id="action_account_deferred_schedule" model="ir.actions.act_window">
        <field name="name">Deferred Schedules</field>
        <field name="res_model">account.deferred.schedule</field>
        <field name="view_mode">list,kanban,form</field>
        <field name="search_view_id" ref="view_account_deferred_schedule_search"/>
        <field name="context">{'search_default_filter_confirmed': 1}</field>
        <field name="help" type="html">
            <p class="o_view_nocontent_smiling_face">
                Create your first deferred revenue schedule
            </p>
            <p>
                Deferred schedules let you recognize revenue or expenses
                across multiple periods.  Link each schedule to a posted
                invoice, choose the deferred and recognition accounts,
                and pick a recognition method (straight-line, date-based,
                or manual) to generate the period-by-period plan.
            </p>
            <p>
                This module helps you comply with ASC 606 / IFRS 15
                revenue recognition requirements.
            </p>
        </field>
    </record>

</odoo>
